# Code owners for license-sensitive paths.
#
# See MODEL_POLICY.md for the rationale. GitHub uses this file to
# request a review from the listed owner automatically when a pull
# request touches these paths. Branch protection on `main` does not
# currently require code-owner approval, so this file routes reviews;
# it does not by itself block a merge. Merging changes to these paths
# without the maintainer's review is against project policy.

# Catch-all: every path is owned by the maintainer.
*                                    @a-birger

# Model registry and license-posture infrastructure.
/bpp/registry/                       @a-birger
/bpp/scoring/model_base.py           @a-birger
/bpp/scoring/face_*.py               @a-birger
/bpp/scoring/*_embed*.py             @a-birger
/bpp/utils/download.py               @a-birger

# The contributor policy itself.
/MODEL_POLICY.md                     @a-birger
/.github/CODEOWNERS                  @a-birger

# CI / release plumbing — accidental edits can silently disable a
# check or publish an untested build.
/.github/workflows/                  @a-birger
/pyproject.toml                      @a-birger
